      }
    },
    "Keep your knees steady so your ankles do the work" : {
      "extractionState" : "automatic",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tieni ferme le ginocchia, così lavorano le caviglie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your protein and your hard sets up while the weight comes down: that is how lean mass holds." : {
      "extractionState" : "automatic",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantieni alte proteine e serie dure mentre il peso scende: così la massa magra regge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps these exercises, sets and supersets. Tempo sets the loads each time you run it." : {
      "extractionState" : "automatic",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
