    "Per 100 g, using the UK front-of-pack bands. Fat is medium above 3 g and high above 17.5 g. Saturates 1.5 g and 5 g, sugars 5 g and 22.5 g, salt 0.3 g and 1.5 g. Drinks use lower limits per 100 ml." : {
