    "Your plan will decide each day whether to take it." : {
      "extractionState" : "automatic",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo piano deciderà ogni giorno se prenderlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your program was long, so only the first part was read. Check the days below and re-import the rest if anything is missing." : {
      "extractionState" : "automatic",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La scheda era lunga, quindi è stata letta solo la prima parte. Controlla i giorni qui sotto e reimporta il resto se manca qualcosa."
